{{!
    @template local_dimensions/enrolment_opens_chip

    The tracker card's "Enrolment opens on" chip, a partial of progress_card_body: the day the
    enrolment window refusing a none, suspended or ended card opens. Printed whatever showlockeddate
    says; nothing when the state names no such day.

    Context variables required:
    * state (object) - The state area, from the course progress service; only openslabel is read,
      the chip's sentence in plain text, empty when there is none

    @copyright  2026 Anderson Blaine
    @license    http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later

    Example context (json):
    {
        "state": {
            "openslabel": "Enrolment opens on 10/10/26"
        }
    }
}}
{{#state.openslabel}}
<div class="local-dimensions-locked-date" data-region="enrolment-opens">
    <i class="fa fa-calendar" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    {{state.openslabel}}
</div>
{{/state.openslabel}}
